kdownView","markdown":"> 本插件已合并至 **uu 远控增强 1.0.2**，后续不再单独更新。请安装 uuhelper，并按需开启快捷切屏；旧版本保留供历史查询。\n\n## 功能\n\n- 将远控底部默认控制栏中的「展开所有窗口」替换为「显示器1」。\n- 将远控底部默认控制栏中的「显示桌面」替换为「显示器2」。\n- 在底部栏点击即可直接切换对应显示器，无需进入多层菜单。\n- 当前显示器对应的文字和图标显示为蓝色高亮状态。\n- 记住各显示器的缩放比例与平移定位，在切换显示器以及 App 切到后台返回后自动恢复视角。\n\n## 兼容\n\n- iOS 15.0 及以上系统\n- Rootless / RootHide\n- 巨魔注入 / 证书自签","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true}]},{"tabname":"更新日志","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://github.com/5hux1n/UUScreenSwitch","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdev","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 频道","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdevchat","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 群组","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium